ãMy Potential Released!ã

7274
00:01:56,530 --> 00:01:58,110
Transfer!

7275
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:07,670
I can guarantee the level of heat!
Get steamed up!

7276
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:10,580
Dragon's fire.

7277
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:16,050
Shit! Red Dragon Emperor!

7278
00:02:21,010 --> 00:02:24,220
You'll die if we keep going.

7279
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:30,940
If it's for him, it'll be an honor.

7280
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:35,360
Why are you so loyal to Cao Cao?

7281
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:41,830
You know how possessors
of a sacred gear are treated.

7282
00:02:42,490 --> 00:02:47,370
They are hated, ostracized,
and persecuted no matter where they go.

7283
00:02:47,710 --> 00:02:53,430
But... If you receive words
that blow all of that away...

7284
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:58,510
...it can't be helped if you want
to live your life for that person!

7285
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:01,260
Maybe he's just using you.

7286
00:03:01,260 --> 00:03:02,930
What's wrong with that?

7287
00:03:02,930 --> 00:03:06,270
My shitty life has finally 
become worth something!

7288
00:03:06,270 --> 00:03:09,690
What the hell is wrong with that,
Red Dragon Emperor!

7289
00:03:10,270 --> 00:03:15,190
My powers will help him
destroy devils, angels, and gods!

7290
00:03:15,190 --> 00:03:17,820
Is there anything more amazing than that?!

7291
00:03:18,030 --> 00:03:21,570
Besides... you're my enemy!

7292
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:25,330
Yeah, that's right! I'm a devil!

7293
00:03:32,790 --> 00:03:37,460
But there are people who'll
shed tears because of you guys!

7294
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:41,610
No matter what reason you have,
I have to take you down!

7295
00:03:44,890 --> 00:03:46,350
Red Dragon Emperor...

7296
00:03:46,350 --> 00:03:48,890
Let's go to your mom.

7297
00:03:48,890 --> 00:03:49,980
Yes.

7298
00:03:56,690 --> 00:03:58,780
Hey! Sorry for the wait!

7299
00:03:58,780 --> 00:03:59,940
Thank goodness you're okay.

7300
00:03:59,940 --> 00:04:00,860
You guys, too!

7301
00:04:00,860 --> 00:04:02,280
--Of course!
--Yes!

7302
00:04:02,530 --> 00:04:05,070
Huh? And...

7303
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:08,870
Xenovia, what's that?

7304
00:04:08,870 --> 00:04:11,710
Oh, it just arrived from the Church.

7305
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:13,750
It's the modified Durandal.

7306
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:16,210
So it managed to make it in the nick of time!

7307
00:04:19,670 --> 00:04:21,800
It looks like the other 
party is waiting for us.

7308
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,600
Yeah.

7309
00:04:25,970 --> 00:04:28,510
You are all truly astounding.

7310
00:04:28,510 --> 00:04:30,220
Cao Cao!

7311
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:36,480
Mother!

7312
00:04:36,900 --> 00:04:38,690
Mother! It's Kunou!

7313
00:04:39,150 --> 00:04:43,030
Mother! What's wrong?! Please wake up!

7314
00:04:43,900 --> 00:04:46,990
You bastards! What have 
you done to my mother?!

7315
00:04:46,990 --> 00:04:48,580
Didn't I tell you?

7316
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:54,010
We are having her help us with
an experiment, little princess.

7317
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:14,480
This is the legendary youkai,
the nine-tailed fox...

7318
00:05:15,190 --> 00:05:16,940
Mother...

7319
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:21,530
A nine-tailed fox is the 
highest class of youkai.

7320
00:05:21,530 --> 00:05:25,570
The city of Kyoto, which has an
unbreakable bond with them,

7321
00:05:25,570 --> 00:05:30,200
was built using techniques
that fill it with chi.

7322
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:34,410
If we use the power of the nine-tailed
fox and such a city together...

7323
00:05:34,410 --> 00:05:37,290
...we can call Great Red into this dimension.

7324
00:05:37,580 --> 00:05:38,630
What did you say?!

7325
00:05:38,960 --> 00:05:41,920
That guy just likes to hang
out in the Dimensional Gap,

7326
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,710
but he doesn't cause anyone problems!

7327
00:05:43,710 --> 00:05:44,840
It is as you say.

7328
00:05:45,170 --> 00:05:49,050
However, he is a troublesome
existence to our boss.

7329
00:05:49,050 --> 00:05:52,060
She wants to return home, 
but he's in the way.

7330
00:05:52,260 --> 00:05:53,680
As I thought...

7331
00:05:53,850 --> 00:05:54,770
Orphis?

7332
00:05:55,310 --> 00:05:59,690
So, you plan to call Great 
Red here and kill him?

7333
00:06:00,150 --> 00:06:04,280
I wonder. We have to catch him first.

7334
00:06:04,280 --> 00:06:07,070
Don't you have any interest in him?

7335
00:06:07,070 --> 00:06:13,200
For instance, the effect of Dragon Eater
against the Red Dragon God Emperor?

7336
00:06:13,410 --> 00:06:18,710
I don't really get it, but I'll have you
return their leader no matter what!

7337
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:20,420
Issei is right!

7338
00:06:21,500 --> 00:06:24,880
Your actions put everyone in danger.

7339
00:06:25,670 --> 00:06:28,130
It would be best to stop you now.

7340
00:06:28,130 --> 00:06:29,800
I agree with Xenovia.

7341
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:30,720
Ditto!

7342
00:06:31,390 --> 00:06:35,180
Anyone involved with the Gremory family
always walks the line of life and death...

7343
00:06:35,470 --> 00:06:38,190
Well, it's for everyone, 
including my friends.

7344
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:43,150
Vritra, looks like we can go all out today.

7345
00:06:43,440 --> 00:06:46,860
My alter ego. Which is my prey?

7346
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:49,070
That holy spear?

7347
00:06:49,070 --> 00:06:52,930
Or the fox? Either is fine with me.

7348
00:06:59,580 --> 00:07:00,710
Here's the first move.

7349
00:07:00,710 --> 00:07:02,380
Take this!

7350
00:07:12,930 --> 00:07:14,180
Huh?

7351
00:07:14,180 --> 00:07:16,310
Huuuh?!

7352
00:07:18,180 --> 00:07:19,350
Whew!

7353
00:07:19,350 --> 00:07:20,940
Don't whew! Not a whew situation!

7354
00:07:20,940 --> 00:07:23,480
Don't make a face like you
just finished a work shift!

7355
00:07:23,480 --> 00:07:25,770
The opening attack is always important.

7356
00:07:25,770 --> 00:07:27,780
Hey, hey, hey...

7357
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:33,620
This new Durandal was made by
combining Excalibur to it with alchemy.

7358
00:07:34,580 --> 00:07:36,470
And I've named it as well.

7359
00:07:37,200 --> 00:07:38,830
Ex-Durandal.

7360
00:07:39,370 --> 00:07:43,000
Well, if he fell with that, we won't
have to go through much trouble.

7361
00:07:49,670 --> 00:07:51,470
That was nice.

7362
00:07:51,930 --> 00:07:56,180
All of you are already at the level
of any high-ranking devil's family.

7363
00:07:57,260 --> 00:08:01,810
I can't believe Shalba Beelzebub
looked down on any of you.

7364
00:08:02,100 --> 00:08:08,400
Caught up in their old ways, they couldn't
see those rising up below them... I believe.

7365
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:10,190
Now, then. What should we do?

7366
00:08:10,190 --> 00:08:13,780
Well, for now... Georg!

7367
00:08:13,780 --> 00:08:15,240
Begin the experiment.

7368
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,490
Roger.

7369
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:28,130
At a quick glance, I can tell he's
using Norse magic, demonic spells,

7370
00:08:28,130 --> 00:08:32,300
fallen angel spells, black magic,
white magic, and fairy magic spells.

7371
00:08:32,300 --> 00:08:35,110
He has control over quite
an extensive spell library.

7372
00:08:44,690 --> 00:08:47,360
The spell circle and placement
of the sacrifice is good.

7373
00:08:47,940 --> 00:08:52,030
Now we will see if Great Red is
attracted to the city's power.

7374
00:08:52,190 --> 00:08:55,160
Roger. I leave the rest to you.

7375
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:59,210
All right. Well, Siegfried.
Who will you go after?

7376
00:09:03,330 --> 00:09:05,420
Jeanne. Heracles.

7377
00:09:05,420 --> 00:09:08,840
Then, I'll fight with the little angel there.

7378
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:11,340
I'll deal with the silver lady there.

7379
00:09:13,050 --> 00:09:15,430
And, my opponent is the Red Dragon Emperor.

7380
00:09:18,220 --> 00:09:19,850
What about Vritra over there?

7381
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:22,810
Saji, take care of the nine-tailed leader.

7382
00:09:23,430 --> 00:09:25,940
Help her escape that spot somehow.

7383
00:09:25,940 --> 00:09:29,150
Got it. I'll handle the monster.

7384
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:32,440
Hyoudou, don't die.

7385
00:09:32,900 --> 00:09:35,530
Yeah. You, too.

7386
00:09:35,530 --> 00:09:37,450
Vritra Promotion!

7387
00:09:45,330 --> 00:09:46,790
Well, well...

7388
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:51,640
One of the five great dragon kings,
Prison Dragon Vritra.

7389
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:55,470
So he really has returned.

7390
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,890
Asia.

7391
00:09:57,890 --> 00:09:58,970
Take care of Kunou!

7392
00:09:58,970 --> 00:09:59,910
Yes!

7393
00:10:00,430 --> 00:10:02,640
Kunou, can you take care of Asia?

7394
00:10:03,020 --> 00:10:06,600
Of course! However...

7395
00:10:06,890 --> 00:10:09,060
Yeah, I know.

7396
00:10:09,650 --> 00:10:13,320
I... We will be the ones to save your mother!

7397
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,280
Yes!

7398
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:17,240
Welsh Dragon Balance Breaker!

7399
00:10:20,530 --> 00:10:23,240
Are you stronger than Vali?

7400
00:10:23,490 --> 00:10:27,330
Who knows? However, I'm not weak.

7401
00:10:27,330 --> 00:10:29,920
Though I am of the weak human race.

7402
00:10:53,610 --> 00:10:58,240
Issei hasn't contacted us since earlier.
Aren't you worried?

7403
00:10:58,400 --> 00:11:02,200
No. I just feel restless since
I'm not there with him.

7404
00:11:02,450 --> 00:11:05,200
That's right, it's probably my imagination...

7405
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:10,500
Right now, he must be enjoying
his last night in Kyoto.

7406
00:11:10,710 --> 00:11:14,460
Issei may have been seduced by
the night of the old capital...

7407
00:11:14,460 --> 00:11:15,960
Oh, your underwear...

7408
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:18,420
Huh? Oh, this?

7409
00:11:18,420 --> 00:11:20,990
They're new. What do you think?

7410
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:23,140
They are cute.

7411
00:11:24,100 --> 00:11:27,980
Rias, you're trying so hard
for someone who isn't here.

7412
00:11:27,980 --> 00:11:29,600
You must really miss him.

7413
00:11:33,610 --> 00:11:34,520
Issei...

7414
00:11:52,370 --> 00:11:54,210
Looks like I'll need both swords!

7415
00:11:55,880 --> 00:12:01,840
Since you're here, let me show
it to you. Balance Break!

7416
00:12:09,350 --> 00:12:10,480
Six swords?!

7417
00:12:10,850 --> 00:12:14,650
Demon swords Tyrfing and Dainsleif.

7418
00:12:14,650 --> 00:12:17,690
I also have a sword of light for devils.

7419
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:20,110
He's like an Asura.

7420
00:12:20,110 --> 00:12:23,410
This is my Chaos Edge, Asura Ravage.

7421
00:12:23,410 --> 00:12:29,450
Like my Twice Critical... this Balance
Breaker is also a subspecies!

7422
00:12:30,830 --> 00:12:33,290
Look at you! As expected of an angel.

7423
00:12:33,290 --> 00:12:35,500
I'll show you something good in return!

7424
00:12:40,090 --> 00:12:42,340
This is Blade Blacksmith.

7425
00:12:42,590 --> 00:12:46,800
It's the holy version of the
holy/demon version that guy has.

7426
00:12:47,430 --> 00:12:48,690
On top of that...

7427
00:12:49,180 --> 00:12:50,270
Here I go.

7428
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,560
Balance Break.

7429
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:09,450
A dragon made of holy swords?

7430
00:13:10,410 --> 00:13:15,170
This is my Balance Breaker, 
Stake Victim Dragon.

7431
00:13:15,540 --> 00:13:17,750
Just like Sieg, it's a subspecies.

7432
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:20,420
The holy maiden Jeanne d'Arc...

7433
00:13:20,420 --> 00:13:23,800
I can't believe I'm fighting against
someone who inherited her soul.

7434
00:13:24,260 --> 00:13:27,300
But this is for Lord 
Michael and everyone else!

7435
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:28,640
Peace is number one!

7436
00:13:32,850 --> 00:13:35,150
All of you guys...

7437
00:13:35,690 --> 00:13:37,400
Balance Break!

7438
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:53,790
This is my Balance Breaker,
Detonation Mighty Comet!

7439
00:14:16,390 --> 00:14:20,980
How is it? This bargain 
sale of Balance Breakers.

7440
00:14:21,610 --> 00:14:25,320
Are you going to go into Balance
Breaker mode like everyone else?

7441
00:14:25,530 --> 00:14:30,330
No, no. I can defeat all of
you without going that far.

7442
00:14:31,120 --> 00:14:32,990
Enough talk.

7443
00:14:33,370 --> 00:14:37,120
Show me the powers of the Red Dragon Emperor!

7444
00:14:38,330 --> 00:14:39,540
Now, come!

7445
00:14:40,330 --> 00:14:41,000
Here I come!

7446
00:14:50,550 --> 00:14:54,850
You aren't weak. You just 
have a lot of openings.

7447
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:01,610
Issei!

7448
00:15:11,740 --> 00:15:14,490
Now it's sink or swim.

7449
00:15:14,790 --> 00:15:17,330
Did you realize you were just about to die?

7450
00:15:18,370 --> 00:15:21,130
It's surprisingly really easy to die, right?

7451
00:15:21,500 --> 00:15:25,630
Remember this well. That was the holy spear.

7452
00:15:25,630 --> 00:15:30,720
No matter how strong you become,
you cannot overcome this attack.

7453
00:15:31,090 --> 00:15:33,100
That's because you're a devil.

7454
00:15:38,180 --> 00:15:41,100
Oh, my. That didn't scare you.

7455
00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:43,400
I thought you'd show me more fear.

7456
00:15:43,730 --> 00:15:46,530
Huh? Of course I'm scared.

7457
00:15:46,530 --> 00:15:49,360
But I can't worry about that now.

7458
00:15:49,610 --> 00:15:54,200
Everyone will be mad at me if I don't
give you a good punch in the face.

7459
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:57,490
It's pretty hard being the
Red Dragon Emperor, you know?

7460
00:15:58,580 --> 00:15:59,830
That's nice.

7461
00:16:00,790 --> 00:16:06,710
I see. I'm starting to understand
why Vali took a liking to you.

7462
00:16:07,880 --> 00:16:11,260
Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost!
Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost!

7463
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:14,350
Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost!

7464
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:18,310
Boost! Boost! Boost! Boost! 
Boost! Boost! Boost!

7465
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:23,730
If only I could get my attacks to connect!

7466
00:16:31,950 --> 00:16:38,270
Thinking of your physique, Ascalon's attack
wave should be enough to hurt you.

7467
00:16:43,170 --> 00:16:46,000
Phoenix tears! Why do you have that?!

7468
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,750
We obtained them through illegal routes.

7469
00:16:48,090 --> 00:16:49,590
What did you say?!

7470
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:53,470
Your aura increased with your anger.

7471
00:16:53,470 --> 00:16:58,060
The fact that your aura responds to your
feelings may lead to your downfall.

7472
00:16:58,060 --> 00:17:03,270
You activated your
Juggernaut Drive that way before.

7473
00:17:03,270 --> 00:17:05,060
That's none of your business!

7474
00:17:08,690 --> 00:17:11,990
While you jumped about,
I cut you in various places.

7475
00:17:11,990 --> 00:17:14,410
Even so, that was a good attack.

7476
00:17:14,410 --> 00:17:17,570
Looks like I have to go up a gear myself.

7477
00:17:18,910 --> 00:17:22,580
Ddraig. Sorry, can you reconstruct the armor?

7478
00:17:22,580 --> 00:17:24,000
I'm already trying.

7479
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:28,250
It seems the effects of the
holy spear are giving me trouble.

7480
00:17:28,250 --> 00:17:30,500
You're still fighting?

7481
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:34,110
Irina!

7482
00:17:34,930 --> 00:17:37,590
Well, it's the Red Dragon Emperor.

7483
00:17:37,590 --> 00:17:39,180
I'm sure he's stronger than the others.

7484
00:17:42,350 --> 00:17:44,230
Kiba! Xenovia!

7485
00:17:44,230 --> 00:17:47,480
I wish I'd fought with the
Red Dragon Emperor instead.

7486
00:17:51,530 --> 00:17:52,940
Rossweisse!

7487
00:17:53,190 --> 00:17:56,320
You are all strong. You are.

7488
00:17:56,320 --> 00:18:00,410
However, that strength is
still not enough to beat us.

7489
00:18:00,410 --> 00:18:02,410
Georg, how are things over there?

7490
00:18:04,370 --> 00:18:05,500
Almost there.

7491
00:18:05,710 --> 00:18:08,650
I think he'll come after this.

7492
00:18:12,250 --> 00:18:15,010
Looks like the nine-tail 
is almost done as well.

7493
00:18:24,020 --> 00:18:26,010
We will all protect Kyoto with our lives!

7494
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:31,110
Azazel, I still haven't 
been able to do anything...

7495
00:18:31,110 --> 00:18:33,390
Mother!

7496
00:18:33,980 --> 00:18:37,970
I promised her I'd save her mom.
And I haven't done anything.

7497
00:18:39,410 --> 00:18:41,580
Why am I so weak?

7498
00:18:41,580 --> 00:18:44,080
I always falter at the most important times.

7499
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:48,120
It was fun, Red Dragon Emperor.

7500
00:18:52,750 --> 00:18:56,840
No matter how much I try and try,
I can't reach him...

7501
00:18:58,010 --> 00:19:00,210
Is this my limit?

7502
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:02,550
Why am I...

7503
00:19:03,510 --> 00:19:06,180
No, I don't want to give up!

7504
00:19:06,180 --> 00:19:08,140
I still want to fight!

7505
00:19:08,770 --> 00:19:12,160
But my hands don't reach them!

7506
00:19:13,190 --> 00:19:14,480
Are you going to cry?

7507
00:19:17,990 --> 00:19:19,660
Elsha?!

7508
00:19:19,660 --> 00:19:20,910
Yes, that's right.

7509
00:19:21,870 --> 00:19:23,180
Why are you crying?

7510
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:32,320
I'm so frustrated. I don't 
know why I'm so weak.

7511
00:19:33,420 --> 00:19:37,380
I'm so useless when it counts!

7512
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:40,340
I see. Of course that's frustrating.

7513
00:19:41,260 --> 00:19:43,180
But, did you forget?

7514
00:19:43,930 --> 00:19:49,560
Boob Dragon! That's great.
You're different from Vali.

7515
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:55,070
You should master the power of the
Red Dragon Emperor your own way!

7516
00:19:57,650 --> 00:20:00,490
I'm the Boob Dragon!

7517
00:20:00,490 --> 00:20:02,990
That's right. That's who you are.

7518
00:20:02,990 --> 00:20:05,910
The current Red Dragon Emperor, Boob Dragon.

7519
00:20:05,910 --> 00:20:12,400
Now, release it! The potential
that Belzard and I saw within you!

7520
00:20:13,210 --> 00:20:16,050
Hold that orb up toward 
the sky and call for it!

7521
